# Code Owners 自动审查规则
# GitHub 会在 PR 中自动指派审查者
# 详见: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# 默认: 主人审查
*       @owner

# 部署 / 运维 (敏感, 需主人确认)
/tools/        @owner
/docker/       @owner
/docs/deploy.md @owner
/.env.example  @owner

# 数据库 schema (修改需谨慎)
/src/lib/db/schema.ts @owner
/drizzle/      @owner

# 加密 / 审计 (合规相关)
/src/lib/crypto/ @owner
/src/lib/audit/  @owner
/docs/security-compliance.md @owner